"Full magical fatigue comes from overusing a skill past what the user can bear."
"The fatigued wander aimlessly, then sink into apathy and agree to anything."
"A couple of hours of sleep brings full recovery."
"Most heroes reach it only after hours of skill use."
"Using a skill weighs on the user like a willpower-like metaphysical load."
"Some feel skill fatigue physically too, like synesthesia; this is more common in Rabbits."
"Spell impressions exhaust a separate portion of bound authority from skills."
